nchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constraintViolation()"},{"text":" before anything else, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker has finished. A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text",